{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "TiQR Store APIs (Whatomate Flow Node)",
    "description": "APIs used by the Whatomate chatbot **TiQR Store** flow node (`tiqr_store_api`).\n\nThe node has an **API type** dropdown:\n- **MCP** \u2192 `tools/call` on the tiqr-buyer MCP server (`ai_commerce_mcp_url` + key + store id)\n- **REST** \u2192 ticker-events buyer HTTP under `/service/buyer/` (`ai_commerce_rest_url` + store id)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `mcp_base_url` (e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:8100`) and `mcp_api_key` for MCP folder.\n2. Set `rest_base_url` (e.g. `https://api.example.com`, no trailing slash) for REST folder.\n3. Set `store_id` and other sample IDs.\n\nMCP-only ops (no guest REST): Check delivery, Lookup order status, Retry payment.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
